00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:26.440
My name is Verbeck.

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:28.290
What happened back there?

00:15:28.290 --> 00:15:32.080
Are you trying to start a war 
between us and the guys

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:34.450
who want to bring down the shogunate?

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:38.050
Now that the shogunate's done with you,

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:41.000
you're trying to make money by selling 
to those samurai, aren't you?

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.880
You always were a clever guy.

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.960
I won't let you feed on those samurai.

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:48.380
Old man...

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:49.130
So?

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.380
I'm not here for me.

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:53.090
I'm here for him.

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:56.050
No! I don't understand.

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:59.680
Now it's his turn to fight you.

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:01.690
Fight us?

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:07.650
Another game for the girl 
you took from me back there.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:10.030
That wasn't the deal.

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:12.570
You said you'd pay for that ship with the girl!

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:17.660
That's why I said this isn't my battle, but his.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:18.660
Right?

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:26.420
Yeah. Give back Kiriko.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:29.300
I'll fight you with my ultimate fists!

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:32.890
This isn't perfect at all.

00:16:32.890 --> 00:16:34.290
Ta-da.

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:37.520
You're not perfect, either.

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:41.280
You're showing a doctored picture 
of samurai you don't even have

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:44.270
to the people in your home 
country to make money.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:45.900
H-How'd you find that?

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:48.490
I snatched it up in the bathhouse.

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:52.610
Maybe I'll show this picture to Katsura or Saigo.

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:57.620
I'm sure they'd be surprised to 
find out you were using them.

00:16:58.500 --> 00:16:59.780
You thief!

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:01.580
You're the thieves!

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:06.620
I don't know what's going on, but I won't 
let you take advantage of the samurai.

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:08.460
We fight like men!

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:11.130
Very well.

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:13.510
But we're merchants, too.

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:17.090
What will you bet, young man?

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:19.300
Let me see...

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:22.630
How about the Union, then?

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:24.990
The Union?

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:27.740
That's perfect, right, Ver-bigdick?

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:29.020
It's Verbeck!

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:31.800
Are you sure?

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:34.170
I'm always serious.

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:35.520
She's your woman.

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:36.960
You win her back.

00:17:36.960 --> 00:17:38.530
Yeah, got it.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.530
One round.

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:42.580
If he wins, he gets the girl.

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:46.080
If you win, you get the ship back.

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:48.790
Perfect.

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.730
Okay, here we go.

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:51.710
Come on.

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:54.600
Rock!

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:55.470
Paper!

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:56.470
Scissors!

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.030
All right!

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.180
No!

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:05.140
Now, give back Kiriko!

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:07.150
Hold up.

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:08.850
I won't let you have the girl.

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:11.620
Wasn't this a fight between men?

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:13.730
Glo-chan's a pervert.

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:16.740
And you're a traitor. I kill traitors!

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.360
Fine.

00:18:19.650 --> 00:18:20.700
A white flag?

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:28.810
What was that?

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:30.420
That was a blank round.

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:35.760
On my next signal, the cannon you guys 
love so much will destroy Dejima.

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:40.620
Oh, no!

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:44.230
This is how I do things.

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:47.900
Are you okay, Kiriko?

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:49.440
Keiichiro-sama...

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:53.580
I'm sorry, I... had the wrong idea.

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:55.160
About the seal, too.

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:56.070
It's fine.

00:18:56.430 --> 00:18:57.500
That's right!

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:58.230
The seal!

00:18:58.230 --> 00:19:00.280
Want to play another round?

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:03.240
You bastard...

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:05.150
I like those eyes.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:08.960
This time, you bet your life.

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:10.380
My life?

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:12.850
Yup. You bet your life on this match.

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:14.960
How about it? Do you value your life?

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:16.710
Keiichiro-sama...

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:18.890
All right.

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:20.760
If I lose, you can have my life.

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:24.150
One round this time, then.

00:19:24.150 --> 00:19:25.390
Sounds good to me.

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:29.230
Rock!

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.100
Paper!

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.270
Scissors!

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:33.230
All right!

00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:37.860
You've got the greatest fist 
in Japan. That was great.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:40.240
Take it, best in Japan!

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:46.700
That seal will determine 
the fate of this country.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:48.630
Listen to me.

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:51.710
The red demon, Takemikazuchi, 
has awakened in Edo.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:55.050
Takemikazuchi?

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:57.050
The foreigners are getting anxious.

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:59.380
Who will take over Japan?

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:02.220
Shigeyoshi, the forces opposing the shogunate,

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:03.680
or...

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:06.580
The sea is big!

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:08.650
And it's connected with other countries.

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:12.630
We can't shut ourselves off 
and hide in this one forever.

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:14.650
So we can't escape from them?

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:16.780
What will you do?

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:20.410
What if you end up ruling Japan?

00:20:21.390 --> 00:20:23.640
I don't know about all that complicated stuff.

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:29.300
But I won't pretend to ignore it like I have so far.

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:31.080
I'll face my problems 
head-on and destroy them!

00:20:31.590 --> 00:20:33.580
Is that your answer?

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:38.460
It's a new dawn for Japan!

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:47.120
So long, old man.

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:48.550
We'll meet again.

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:51.440
Did you lose deliberately back there?

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:53.430
I'm always serious.

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:57.190
Tokugawa Keiichiro...

00:20:57.710 --> 00:21:01.300
He may be able to change Japan.

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:02.440
How did you know that name?

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:06.400
I wanted to see him with my own eyes.

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:08.160
Who are you?

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:11.360
I've forgotten my name.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.760
More importantly...

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:16.600
How about a night with me sometime?

00:21:17.270 --> 00:21:18.610
No!

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:23.800
As long as you're alive, 
you better enjoy it, you two!

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:29.960
Now then, we're going to get busy!

00:21:29.960 --> 00:21:31.760
Union, engage!

00:21:35.680 --> 00:21:37.520
Who was he?

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:38.770
I don't know.

00:21:39.430 --> 00:21:41.120
But I do know one thing.

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:44.860
No matter what happens 
from now on, I won't run.

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:47.360
I'll face my problems 
head-on and destroy them.

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:49.260
Follow me.

00:21:49.260 --> 00:21:50.870
Okay, Kiriko?

00:21:51.860 --> 00:21:54.060
Yes, Keiichiro-sama...

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:29.700
Hyakusuke, the ice woman and Kei-chan 
have been close lately, haven't they?

00:23:29.700 --> 00:23:31.370
They're in love, after all!

00:23:31.370 --> 00:23:34.070
I knew it! I won't let it happen! Never!

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:35.480
Don't go crazy now!

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:38.160
Next time, another big rampage 
to decide the fate of Japan!

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Next Time: 
Cherry Blossom Baths Love Stories</b>

00:23:38.160 --> 00:23:39.260
Let's do this!
